{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16212080","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16212080","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1621208001:1":{"text":"不思議です……リスが次から次へと出てきて、列をなすなんて……","source_cn":"神奇……松鼠们竟然排着长队自己走出来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBAD5D2B8F1D3886A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1621208002:1":{"text":"ねっ、驚かせなかったでしょ？次は、どの子に問題があるのか見てみるよ。","source_cn":"没有惊扰到它们，对吗？现在，让我来看看是哪只小家伙出了问题。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x409ADE44C080EE00","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1621208003:1":{"text":"この子の気配……乱れていて不安定だ。爪先もかすかに震えている。","source_cn":"看这只的气息……紊乱、虚浮，爪尖还有微微的颤抖。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8E66D65969156C20","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1621208004:1":{"text":"なるほど、このリスには<style=\"highlight\">中毒</style>の症状がある。この森のものではない木の実でも食べたんだろう……このまま毒が回れば、命が危ない。","source_cn":"原来如此，这只松鼠<style=highlight>中...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x747F982A92A13B97","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1621208005:1":{"text":"どうにか解毒する方法を考えなければ……","source_cn":"我们得想办法给这个小家伙解毒。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x85640D7BDD5FE967","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1621208006:1":{"text":"ハーメルは手慣れた様子で小冊子を取り出した。そして素早くページをめくると、図と文字でびっしり埋まった処方箋を一枚抜き取った。","source_cn":"哈梅尔熟练地抽出一本随身小册子，快速翻阅后，抽出一页写...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x15EF1E4288571042","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1621208007:1":{"text":"メイジさんたち……これは<style=\"highlight\">緩和薬のレシピ</style>だ。必要な材料はそれほど多くないから、代わりに集めてきてほしい。","source_cn":"两位魔法师朋友——这是<style=highlight...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA4F18DC6A05C956F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1621208008:1":{"text":"僕はこの子の呼吸のリズムを整え、弱った心臓を落ち着かせてやらないといけない。","source_cn":"我暂时要替它理一理呼吸的节奏，稳住这颗小心脏。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAD2D73916C70924A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:9:1621208008":{"text":"僕はこの子の呼吸のリズムを整え、弱った心臓を落ち着かせてやらないといけない。","source_cn":"我暂时要替它理一理呼吸的节奏，稳住这颗小心脏。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAD2D73916C70924A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1621208009:0":{"text":"ありがとう。できればリサイタルは短時間で済ませたい。この小さな聴衆は、そんなに長く持ちこたえられそうにないから……","source_cn":"点头即允诺。希望这首曲子不必演奏太久，我们的小听众可等...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA6B2D2965931B1AF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1621208014:1":{"text":"じゃあ、頼んだよ。","source_cn":"那么，拜托了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEE08BC32F84A12FE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1621208015:0":{"text":"安心してください、ハーメルさん。すぐに材料を集めて戻ってきますね。","source_cn":"你放心吧，哈梅尔先生，我们会尽快制作舒缓药。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCCCB18C12B88C24F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:9:0:1":{"text":"（頷く）","source_cn":"（点头）","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x71591B958C4E6BDC","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"（頷く）","female":"（頷く）","variant_male_record_index":"88623","variant_female_record_index":"88624","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1621208010:0":{"text":"これまで数え切れない聴衆と向き合ってきたからこそ、この技で人の心を容易に動かせることも知っている……","source_cn":"我与太多耳朵打过交道，深知利用魔法取信很容易……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD3BED507606D5663","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1621208011:0":{"text":"でもこの笛は、誓って誰かを傷つけるために使ったことはない……動物に対しても、人間に対しても。","source_cn":"但我这支笛子，从没用来伤害——对动物是如此，对人亦如此。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA091AE3EB1611B3F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title